{"about_the_game":"Boom Dojo is a rhythm boxing trainer. Targets are generated from your music in realtime.<br><br>You color match targets to your hands and avoid bar contact which hurts your score.<br><br>The score is dynamically calculated as your hits / the current total of emitted targets.<br><br>Target rate is tied to your score so higher scores will yield more targets from a track.<br><br>The better you play the more detail you &quot;squeeze&quot; out of the music hardening the game.<br><br>LIV is also fully supported allowing you to capture your amazing workouts in mixed reality.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1389000?t=1619367726","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1389000?t=1619367726","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1389000/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1619367726","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1389000/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1619367726","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"VR Only","id":54},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"Boom Dojo is a rhythm boxing trainer. Targets are generated from your music in realtime.<br><br>You color match targets to your hands and avoid bar contact which hurts your score.<br><br>The score is dynamically calculated as your hits / the current total of emitted targets.<br><br>Target rate is tied to your score so higher scores will yield more targets from a track.<br><br>The better you play the more detail you &quot;squeeze&quot; out of the music hardening the game.<br><br>LIV is also fully supported allowing you to capture your amazing workouts in mixed reality.","developers":["Yolopia Ltd"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"desc